Package: com.mac.virtual.v2
Name: Virtual Mac @RELEASE@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Description: Standalone Virtual Mac 2 beta with the macOS 27 graphics backend.
 Uses macOS 27 PVG, MetalSerializer, GPU task and private shader compiler with
 the verified Ventura CPU, VMM and Virtualization runtime. Includes its own
 macOS installation helpers, keyboard passthrough and NAT networking, and
 replaces Virtual Mac 1.2.3, which is removed when this package is installed.
 Shut down virtual machines and close both apps before installing, upgrading
 or removing. Virtual machine bundles and converter caches are preserved.
 Supports the tested rootless iPadOS 16 jailbreak only.
Maintainer: liukaixiang817
Author: Virtual Mac contributors
Homepage: https://github.com/liukaixiang817/VirtualMacOniPad
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: firmware (>= 16.1), firmware (<< 16.4), ellekit | org.coolstar.libhooker
Conflicts: com.mac.virtual
Replaces: com.mac.virtual
Tag: role::enduser
